                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Musk and Trump are working feverishly to cut Social Security, Medicaid, the VA, public education, nutrition and other programs. \n\nWhy? So Musk and other billionaires can get a huge tax break.  \n\nTogether, we\u2019re not going to let them get away with that.",
