                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Trump\u2019s Big Beautiful Bill moves to the Senate, we must make it clear: There is\u00a0nothing \u201cbeautiful\u201d about giving huge tax breaks to billionaires while cutting health care, nutrition and education for working families.\n\nIt is grossly immoral and, together, we must defeat it.",
