                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Speaker Johnson says there's \u201ca moral component\u201d to Trump's \u201cbig, beautiful\u201d bill. Really?\n\u00a0\nIs it \u201cmoral\u201d to cut nutrition assistance for hungry kids?\n\u00a0\nIs it \u201cmoral\u201d to eliminate health care for 13.7 million Americans so the 1% gets a $664 billion tax break?\n\nI don\u2019t think so. https://t.co/ed5By4yzfy",
