                "text": "When Mr. Musk, the wealthiest man alive & major campaign contributor, expresses strong distaste for Trump\u2019s Big Beautiful Bill, Republicans will listen & obey. That means more cuts to Medicaid, nutrition & education.\n\nThe oligarchs want it ALL. We\u2019re not going to let that happen.",
